# SpendWise API

A secure and scalable REST API for personal expense management, built with **FastAPI** and **PostgreSQL**.

SpendWise allows users to register and authenticate securely, manage their expenses, filter and paginate expense records, and view spending summaries by category.

---

## 🚀 Features

### Authentication

* User registration
* Secure password hashing using bcrypt
* JWT-based authentication
* Protected API endpoints
* User-level data isolation
* Duplicate email prevention

### Expense Management

* Create expenses
* View all personal expenses
* View a single expense
* Update expenses
* Delete expenses
* Filter expenses by category
* Pagination support

### Expense Analytics

* Total spending
* Total number of expenses
* Category-wise spending summary

### Validation & Security

* Request validation using Pydantic
* JWT authentication
* Protected expense endpoints
* Users can only access their own expenses
* Environment variables for sensitive configuration

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

| Technology       | Purpose                   |
| ---------------- | ------------------------- |
| Python           | Programming language      |
| FastAPI          | REST API framework        |
| PostgreSQL       | Relational database       |
| SQLAlchemy       | ORM                       |
| Pydantic         | Data validation           |
| JWT              | Authentication            |
| Passlib + bcrypt | Password hashing          |
| Uvicorn          | ASGI server               |
| Swagger UI       | API testing/documentation |

